+- A set of $N$ 3D Gaussians.
+- For each Gaussian $i$:
+    - Position $\mathbf{p}_i$.
+    - Camera parameters (position $\mathbf{c}$, orientation).
+    - SH coefficients $\mathbf{k}_i$ (see Data structures).
